# Publish instructions, scripts, demo, and LeRobot source.
*

# Project files
!.gitignore
!README.md
!AGENTS.md

# Scripts
!scripts/
!scripts/install.sh
!scripts/run_orange_juice.sh

# Demos
!demos/
!demos/main_orange_juice.mp4
!demos/main_orange_juice.gif

# LeRobot source code
!lerobot/
lerobot/*
!lerobot/src/
